ng BF% (WMD: −1.17%, 95% CI: −1.85 to −0.50,0.001), while two sessions per week were not significant (WMD: −3.23%, 95% CI: −6.52 to 0.04","estimate":{"outcome":"Body fat percentage","measure":"WMD","point":-1.17,"ciLow":-1.85,"ciHigh":-0.5,"unit":"points","absolute":true,"tier":"low"}}},{"id":"two","label":"Two","ffm":null,"fm":{"id":"fm_2wk","kind":"estimate","label":"Fat mass, 2 sessions a week","quote":"2 and 3 sessions per week had a significant effect on reducing FM (WMD: −4.43 kg, 95% CI: −6.62 to −2.24,0.001 and WMD: −1.24 kg, 95% CI: −2.00 to −0.48","estimate":{"outcome":"Fat mass","measure":"WMD","point":-4.43,"ciLow":-6.62,"ciHigh":-2.24,"unit":"kg","absolute":true,"tier":"moderate"}},"bf":{"id":"bf_2wk","kind":"estimate","label":"Body fat percentage, 2 sessions a week","quote":"three sessions per week had a significant effect on reducing BF% (WMD: −1.17%, 95% CI: −1.85 to −0.50,0.001), while two sessions per week were not significant (WMD: −3.23%, 95% CI: −6.52 to 0.04","estimate":{"outcome":"Body fat percentage","measure":"WMD","point":-3.23,"ciLow":-6.52,"ciHigh":0.04,"unit":"points","absolute":true,"tier":"low"}}}]},{"id":"work","label":"Each work burst","options":[{"id":"short","label":"60 seconds or less","ffm":{"id":"ffm_le60","kind":"estimate","label":"Fat-free mass, work bursts of 60 s or less","quote":"≤60 s produced a significant increase in FFM (WMD: 0.57 kg, 95% CI: 0.29 to 1.44","estimate":{"outcome":"Fat-free mass","measure":"WMD","point":0.57,"ciLow":0.29,"ciHigh":1.44,"unit":"kg","absolute":true,"tier":"high"}},"fm":{"id":"fm_le60","kind":"estimate","label":"Fat mass, work bursts of 60 s or less","quote":"produced a significant reduction in FM (WMD: −2.20 kg, 95% CI: −3.01 to −1.39,0.001 and WMD: −1.14 kg, 95% CI: −2.13 to −0.15","estimate":{"outcome":"Fat mass","measure":"WMD","point":-2.2,"ciLow":-3.01,"ciHigh":-1.39,"unit":"kg","absolute":true,"tier":"moderate"}},"bf":{"id":"bf_le60","kind":"estimate","label":"Body fat percentage, work 